{"about_the_game":"From Director Luc Bernard comes two new stories set in the world of the critically-acclaimed <i>Desert Ashes</i>. Guide Little Thief and Angel through challenging 2D platforming stages, as they seek the wisdom of an enigmatic Professor. Defeat hordes of robotic enemies with the help of the RoboBuddy combat drone and unlock new drones with different attack types, all with 360\u00b0 aiming. <br><br>Controller highly recommended.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714840/extras/ac0abb24be88827e0ce6be892cd2268b.avif?t=1506960452\" width=620 height=111 /></span><br><br>Between you and the Professor are a multitude of machines eager to put a stop to your adventures. Keep your wits about you as you dodge bullets, missiles, and bombs from Jumali's robot army while navigating stages filled with spikes, bottomless pits and other traps. Collect cogs from defeated robots and unlock new drone types with more ways to fight.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714840/extras/c33706c535c2bf8b3c9404548f60f1bf.avif?t=1506960452\" width=620 height=111 /></span><br><br><strong>RoboBuddy:</strong> Simple and dependable, the RoboBuddy's basic form fires a long-range projectile.<br><br><strong>Teslar:</strong> Discharges bolts of electricity that multiply and bounce off walls. Shocking!<br><br><strong>Swanwave:</strong> Who needs to aim? The Swanwave shoots balls of energy in a wave of increasing width. Less effective in tight spaces.<br><br><strong>Rockettoh:</strong> Explosive rockets launched in an arc.<br><br><strong>Bombastii:</strong> Lobs rolling bombs; perfect for enemies beneath you.<br><br><strong>Aquata:</strong> This fishy drone fires a powerful ball of condensed energy at a slow rate.<br><br><strong>Corrosoe:</strong> Launches vials that explode in a shower of deadly acid.<br><br><strong>Flameburster:</strong> Sprays fire at a limited range. Hot stuff!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714840/extras/8a11c157e07c0f79fe4ceff97a4e1d09.avif?t=1506960452\" width=620 height=111 /></span><br><br>More fun with friends! Mecho Tales supports up to four players in cooperative multiplayer. Team up for frenzied, action-packed adventure!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"8853cc181298dcb4983cbf8e55507b1451623971.jpg","localized_name":"Defeat Landian Boss","name":"Defeat Landian Boss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/714840/8853cc181298dcb4983cbf8e55507b1451623971.jpg"},{"icon":"bbc7babe03ad9ee14ed734fe9606e9c6a813c15d.jpg","localized_name":"Cog Master","name":"Cog Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/714840/bbc7babe03ad9ee14ed734fe9606e9c6a813c15d.jpg"},{"icon":"6811c435d5dd3ddd4035daf7c5be4aff44182ec0.jpg","localized_name":"Defeat Golem","name":"Defeat Golem","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/714840/6811c435d5dd3ddd4035daf7c5be4aff44182ec0.jpg"},{"icon":"8c67171039288959cd557ce22e667f8e16fcab4d.jpg","localized_name":"Defeat Mecinni","name":"Defeat Mecinni","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/714840/8c67171039288959cd557ce22e667f8e16fcab4d.jpg"},{"icon":"260c8a71e1807e8422fb14ee72a6ba77d4e4c7a1.jpg","localized_name":"Meet Professor","name":"Meet Professor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/714840/260c8a71e1807e8422fb14ee72a6ba77d4e4c7a1.jpg"},{"icon":"a739ced8c8309d068993e4103dd94948521ea9d6.jpg","localized_name":"Drone Collector","name":"Drone Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/714840/a739ced8c8309d068993e4103dd94948521ea9d6.jpg"},{"icon":"850c809a9d602fd0c8329a29831ff13